    narr:narration """This position holds two moves on the bike repair stand. [Siting at the river path entrance rather than the car park, because that is where the flats happen](narr:Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_1) comes from the parks officer; [chaining the pump, with the prior pump's disappearance in a week as the reason](narr:Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_2) comes from the cycling club. Together they answer both halves of the frame — where the stand goes and what keeps its pump serving cyclists.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_2> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The public repair stand goes by the river path entrance, not in the car park. The river path is where the flats happen." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Put the pump on a chain; the last one walked off in a week." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The two supports address different halves of the question — placement versus pump security — and the pump directive rests on an unnamed prior theft, not on the siting rationale." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261015_6_Batch6Bikestand20261015222221_h5acd0e7425d0_2> ] ;
